# MSI — Buzz + Hermes (ZTE-005)

Runbook: `docs/BUZZ_MSI_AGENTS.md` in Portable-agents.

- [ ] Buzz desktop installed (Windows exe or Bazzite deb/AppImage)
- [ ] Relay URL in Buzz settings → `http://macmini:3000` (Tailscale)
- [ ] Create agent **Studex-MSI**; workdir = Portable-agents clone
- [ ] `./scripts/msi-buzz-preflight.sh` PASS on MSI
- [ ] Hermes gateway + `tailscale serve --bg 8642`; invited in Paperclip
- [ ] `./scripts/agent-work-archive.sh` (sanitized logs only)
